(7185498, 1104669, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the lower 2/3rds with the tone and textures. Might be worth just cropping to that areas. Usually one out of place object adds interest to a photo.  The "O" and the shamrock make two items and it hurts the impact.</td>', 'Love the lower 2/3rds with the tone and textures. Might be worth just cropping to that areas. Usually one out of place object adds interest to a photo.  The "O" and the shamrock make two items and it hurts the impact.', '2014-03-05 08:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
