(7185508, 1104534, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured with the lights coming towards you and turning away.  The blue signs are really bold and are as much a subject as the lights.  A minor nit, but there are no vechicles visable.  I''ll say you met the challenge but others may not.</td>', 'Nicely captured with the lights coming towards you and turning away.  The blue signs are really bold and are as much a subject as the lights.  A minor nit, but there are no vechicles visable.  I''ll say you met the challenge but others may not.', '2014-03-05 08:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7185863, 1104642, 117534, '<td valign="top">In the thumbnail this is my fav hands down, the comp the color the position, Just WOWED me.... but when I open it up it appears "over cooked" the grass and the snow up front looks crunchy, I see a blue halo over the buggy and the horse.  The upper part of the sky on the left is Perfection! the right side down low looks ??? like it''s been smudged upwards? not sure but something behind that buggy just looks wrong.  Ok all the mean stuff being said, Your Picture is AWESOME, just back off the processing a bit and this is a hang in the art gallery piece!</td>', 'In the thumbnail this is my fav hands down, the comp the color the position, Just WOWED me.... but when I open it up it appears "over cooked" the grass and the snow up front looks crunchy, I see a blue halo over the buggy and the horse.  The upper part of the sky on the left is Perfection! the right side down low looks ??? like it''s been smudged upwards? not sure but something behind that buggy just looks wrong.  Ok all the mean stuff being said, Your Picture is AWESOME, just back off the processing a bit and this is a hang in the art gallery piece!', '2014-03-06 00:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
